Package: chronomicrobiome
Type: Package
Title: Longitudinal Human Microbiome and Exposure Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mohammadali", "Khan Mirzaei", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "39282247+KhanMirzaei@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: An exploratory workflow for longitudinal microbial abundance
    tables, exposure-associated changes, persistence, return toward baseline,
    and evidence-supported phage-host associations. Fits random-intercept
    linear mixed models to centered log-ratio abundances and produces
    auditable tables, figures, and an offline HTML report. Includes a
    fully synthetic medication-exposure demonstration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: nlme, ggplot2, yaml, jsonlite, stats, utils, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/KhanMirzaei/ChronoMicrobiome
BugReports: https://github.com/KhanMirzaei/ChronoMicrobiome/issues
